<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
  The app itself is one URL: the board and the chat room live behind #board and
  #chat, and a crawler drops the fragment before it fetches anything — listing
  them here would just submit https://kospinow.com/ again and get flagged as a
  duplicate by Yeti and Google alike.

  The info pages below are real paths, though: standalone static files under
  public/, readable without JavaScript. They exist to give the site crawlable
  substance (and the policy pages ad review requires), so they belong here.
-->
